{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚地把反复追问后的疲惫、仍未断掉的牵挂、先前的柔软经验与无法挽回的限制连成“向前之力逐渐聚起、却只能一次次顶住”的动机链，也指出柔弱不必再被排除；但它对每次发力为何留下残压、末尾为何从试探转为集中推进，以及身体如何先于念头松开停滞，主要是点到结果而未充分展开机制。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙更具体地说明了不确定并未增加、却不再被当作退缩理由，反复用力未换来安全而使压力滞留，以及身体逐渐越过自我检查、把力量转成实际前进并因此暂时解脱的因果链；不过，“无余力把感受分开处理”和“这份在乎值得争取”仍带有心理化或价值性的外推，音响本身不能完全证实。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙的优势不在篇幅，而在于它为残压累积、推进逐渐聚拢和停滞松动分别补上了具体的中间机制，并区分了身体行动带来的暂时解脱与恐惧消失、问题解决或胜算增加，因此即使存在少量外推，整体解释力也不低于甲。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b54ef25c-a0fa-4b84-9571-4190e95f8eb0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140637536668Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.468, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:08:07.004750+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2b94a59eb542bf2f48abb73e7b0f3f1cec80e25af1a72c9b62e12e02548e765a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308